 # Project context
 
-Pricing rules live in app/pricing.py. Public entry point: app.api.quote.
+Pricing rules live in `app/domain/pricing.py`, as recorded in
+[the pricing ownership decision](docs/adr/0002-pricing.md).
+The public entry point is `app.api.quote(subtotal, member=False)`, which passes
+both arguments to `app.domain.pricing.amount(subtotal, member=False)`.
+
+Members (`member=True`) receive 90% of the subtotal. Non-members, including
+existing calls that omit `member`, receive the unchanged subtotal.
+For example, `quote(200, member=True)` returns `180.0`, while `quote(200)` and
+`quote(200, member=False)` return `200`.
+
+`app/pricing.py` remains the unchanged utility for the legacy offline importer.
+
+Run the tests with `python3 -m unittest discover -s tests -v`.
